* Finnish: [[parjata]], [[haukkua]], [[dissata]] (''slang'')
* German: [[dissen]] (''slang'')
* Swedish: [[dissa]] (''slang'')

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# an [[insult]] or [[put-down]]

====Translations====
